      "summary": {
        "direction": "ltr",
        "content": "<p><img src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/ace/branded_news/1200/cpsprodpb/079f/live/4d3e8c50-a126-11f1-8c37-3f30331ac537.jpg\" alt=\"4d3e8c50-a126-11f1-8c37-3f30331ac537.jpg\"></p>The late singer-songwriter's charity causes were as eclectic as her music, but she had a personal connection to each one."
